The critical thing: in C, [38;5;10mstbds_temp((t)-1)[0m accesses the temp field of the array header. The [38;5;10m(t)-1[0m means "go back one element from the hash pointer to get the array pointer". Then [38;5;10m(t)[stbds_temp((t)-1)][0m indexes from [38;5;10mt[0m (the hash pointer, which is element[1]) by the temp index.[0m[0m
