Here [38;5;10mt[0m is a pointer to [38;5;10mIntMapEntry[0m. [38;5;10m(t)-1[0m goes back one element to get the "array" pointer. [38;5;10mstbds_temp((t)-1)[0m gets the temp index. Then [38;5;10m(t)[stbds_temp((t)-1)][0m indexes from [38;5;10mt[0m (which is already offset by 1 element from the array start).[0m[0m
